ID  - 43058048
TI  - Effects of a Prebiotic Functional Soda on Gastrointestinal Symptoms in Adults Receiving GLP-1-Based Therapy for Weight Management: A Randomized Controlled Pilot Trial.
AU  - Grant Azure D
AU  - McCormick Courtney
AU  - Bolster Douglas
AU  - Babazadeh Demsina
