TI  - Polydopamine-coated liposomes for oral delivery of tirzepatide: Overcoming gastrointestinal barriers to improve therapeutic efficacy.
AU  - Wan Xian
AU  - Kong Weibo
AU  - Gao Zihan
AU  - Pan Yafeng
AU  - Long Miaomiao
AU  - Wang Huili
AU  - Chen Weijun
