TI  - Durable and Additive Disease Control at 52 Weeks With Ixekizumab Plus Tirzepatide Versus Ixekizumab Alone in Adults With Psoriatic Arthritis and Obesity or Overweight: Additional Results From a Randomized Clinical Trial.
