TI  - Nephroprotective Effects of the Dual GCGR/GLP-1R Agonist Survodutide in Hypertension-Accelerated Diabetic Kidney Disease.
AU  - Hamilton Alexander
AU  - Thisted Louise
AU  - Ougaard Maria
AU  - Hahn Max
