TI  - Trends in Cost of Care With Tirzepatide in Adults Aged Over 55 Years With Obesity or Overweight Without Diabetes: A Matched Cohort Analysis.
AU  - Upadhyay Navneet
AU  - Bonakdar Ali
AU  - Subedi Keshab
AU  - Banerjee Soutrik
AU  - Behrend Benjamin
AU  - Hankosky Emily R
JO  - Diabetes, obesity & metabolism
